generalize (binary_round_aux_correct prec emax _ _ mode x mx ex lx Bx Ex).
unfold binary_round_aux.
destruct (Rlt_bool (Rabs _) _).
- now destruct BinarySingleNaN.binary_round_aux as [sz|sz| |sz mz ez].
- intros [_ ->].
